#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0112.1 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "PLAN-stopped-rule-engine-fixes item 1 (Define-XML 2.1 section 5.3.12.3: a variable may be documented at the value level only): DM.AGE has no method at the variable level but every value-level entry of its def:ValueListDef (AGEU=WEEKS / DAYS) carries one. The define documents the variable completely, so the rule must not fire. Fires (one finding on AGE) under the rule before its var_vlm_has_method(\"DEFINE\") != true conjunct."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#define-xml CDISC-SEND-0112.1-vlm-define.xml
dataset DM
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col AGE      type=Num
col AGEU     type=Char
---
S1 | S1-001 | 56 | WEEKS
S1 | S1-002 | 70 | DAYS
